  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div style='text-align:Left;'><p><span>Provides the location of child care centres in Peel Region.  The data includes the centre name, address, contact information, and service model type.  This dataset includes all child care centres that are licensed by the Province.  This data is used in the </span><a href='https://www.peelregion.ca/planning-maps/elcc/index.html' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Early Learning and Child Care Web Map</a>, which provides more fulsome information such as available programs and subsidy availability.</p><p><span>These centres can be operated by community-based commercial organisations, non-profit organisations, and school-based centres.</span></p><p>We have other datasets you might find useful with this data:</p><p></p><ul><li><a href='https://data.peelregion.ca/datasets/early-development-instrument-2015-sda-2017' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Early Development Instrument</a>.</li><li><a href='https://data.peelregion.ca/datasets/early-years-forecast-sda17-2016-2041' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Early Years Population Forecasts, 2016-2041</a>.</li></ul><p></p></div>"
